<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('../../partials/head') %></head>
<body class="flex overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950" style="height:100vh;font-family:'Sofia Sans',sans-serif">

  <%- include('../../partials/adminSidebar', { currentPage: 'content' }) %>

  <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col overflow-hidden">

    <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-8 flex items-start justify-center">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900 border border-white/8 rounded-md p-12 max-w-md w-full text-center mt-8">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
          <iconify-icon icon="boxicons:image" width="24" style="color:#60a5fa;display:block"></iconify-icon>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-white/8 text-zinc-500 mb-4">Phase 6</span>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-0 mb-2">Entries Moderation</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Browse every entry submitted to the platform with search and filter controls. Take moderation actions on individual entries.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-zinc-400 text-left flex flex-col gap-2">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="boxicons:circle" width="13" style="color:#52525b;display:block"></iconify-icon>Search by username, caption, or tags</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="boxicons:circle" width="13" style="color:#52525b;display:block"></iconify-icon>Filter by media type (photo / video)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="boxicons:circle" width="13" style="color:#52525b;display:block"></iconify-icon>Entry detail with rating history and contest participation</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="boxicons:circle" width="13" style="color:#52525b;display:block"></iconify-icon>Hide or remove entries from the platform</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </main>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
